    <question no="1" id="PRB-08F593A81E23739E-Q1" type="수치/계산 도출형" category="수리·계산·자료해석형">
      <stem>부피 1 L인 어떤 유체의 무게가 10 N일 때, 이 유체의 밀도[kg m^(-3)]는? (단, 중력가속도는 10 m s^(-2)이다)</stem>
      <choices count="4">
        <choice no="1" is_answer="false">100</choice>
        <choice no="2" is_answer="false">200</choice>
        <choice no="3" is_answer="true">1,000</choice>
        <choice no="4" is_answer="false">2,000</choice>
      </choices>
      <answer source="정답표 (책형교차대조: 일치)" cross_check="일치">3</answer>
      <explanation_ref file="전달현상_해설.xml" question_no="1">정답 ③ · 수리·계산·자료해석형 (부피, 어떤, 유체, 무게)</explanation_ref>
    </question>
    <question no="2" id="PRB-08F593A81E23739E-Q2" type="긍정형(옳은/적절한 것 고르기)" category="핵심 개념·이론 이해형">
      <stem>내부 반지름 $r_i$, 외부 반지름 $r_o$, 길이 $L$, 열전도도 $k$인 원통형 관의 반지름 방향 열전달 저항은?</stem>
      <formulas count="8">
        <formula area="질문">r_i</formula>
        <formula area="질문">r_o</formula>
        <formula area="질문">L</formula>
        <formula area="질문">k</formula>
        <formula area="선택지①">\frac{2 \pi k L}{\ln ( r_{o} / r_{i} )}</formula>
        <formula area="선택지②">\frac{4 \pi k L}{( 1 / r_{i} ) - ( 1 / r_{o} )}</formula>
        <formula area="선택지③">\frac{\ln ( r_{o} / r_{i} )}{2 \pi kL}</formula>
        <formula area="선택지④">\frac{( 1 / r_{i} ) - ( 1 / r_{o} )}{4 \pi k L}</formula>
      </formulas>
      <choices count="4">
        <choice no="1" is_answer="false">$\frac{2 \pi k L}{\ln ( r_{o} / r_{i} )}$</choice>
        <choice no="2" is_answer="false">$\frac{4 \pi k L}{( 1 / r_{i} ) - ( 1 / r_{o} )}$</choice>
        <choice no="3" is_answer="true">$\frac{\ln ( r_{o} / r_{i} )}{2 \pi kL}$</choice>
        <choice no="4" is_answer="false">$\frac{( 1 / r_{i} ) - ( 1 / r_{o} )}{4 \pi k L}$</choice>
      </choices>
      <answer source="정답표 (책형교차대조: 일치)" cross_check="일치">3</answer>
      <explanation_ref file="전달현상_해설.xml" question_no="2">정답 ③ · 핵심 개념·이론 이해형 (내부, 반지름, 외부, 열전도도)</explanation_ref>
    </question>
    <question no="3" id="PRB-08F593A81E23739E-Q3" type="수치/계산 도출형" category="수리·계산·자료해석형">
